# Grid

A sortable grid — drag tiles to reorder within a responsive CSS Grid layout.

Pass `strategy={sortable({ direction: 'grid' })}` to `DndDroppable` and lay the container out with `display: grid`. Drop zones are computed row-by-row from the actual item rects. Use `flow: 'column'` to make the grid fill top-to-bottom instead of left-to-right.

Grid translation math assumes uniform cell sizes — if you mix items with different widths and heights, prefer `display: grid` with equal tracks (for example `grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(110px, 1fr))`) rather than per-item dimensions.

